| `vulnerabilities[].dateAdded` | Date added to KEV |
| `vulnerabilities[].dueDate` | Remediation deadline |

## Priority Scoring Formula

```
priority = cvss_score * 10
  + 30 if in CISA KEV
  + 20 if EPSS > 0.5
  + 10 if EPSS > 0.1
```

