`keylog`, `screenshot`, `clipboard`, `password`, `credential`, `smtp`, `telegram`, `discord`, `webhook`, `stealer`, `inject`, `hook`, `persist`, `startup`

## Usage

```bash
python agent.py suspect.exe
```
