## Workflow 1: IP-Centric Pivoting
```
[Known C2 IP] --> [Shodan/Censys] --> [Service Fingerprints]
      |                                      |
      v                                      v
[Passive DNS] --> [Associated Domains] --> [WHOIS Analysis] --> [Registrant Pivot]
      |                                                               |
      v                                                               v
