[C2 Signature] --> [Shodan Search] --> [Candidate Servers] --> [Validation]
                                                                    |
                                                                    v
                                                          [JARM Fingerprint]
                                                                    |
                                                                    v
                                                          [Confirm C2 Type]
                                                                    |
                                                                    v
                                                          [Track Over Time]
```

## Workflow 4: Continuous Monitoring
