- [ ] Attestation Key created and its public key exported to the verifier.
- [ ] Nonce-bound quote produced and independently verified with `tpm2_checkquote`.
- [ ] Attested PCRs compared against a golden baseline; drift flagged.
- [ ] (Optional) Secret sealed/unsealed against a PCR policy successfully.
- [ ] IMA runtime measurements reviewed where enabled.
- [ ] Results documented per host with pass/fail and any drift evidence.$S$, '{"http_get","python_exec","shell_exec","create_deliverable"}', $S${"source":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","pack":"cybersecurity","domain":"cybersecurity","subdomain":"hardware-firmware-security","tags":["Code","Testing","Automation","Security","Compliance","Data"],"files":2}$S$::jsonb, true)
